<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA TO LAUNCH ELECTRONIC CARCASS AUCTIONS.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA TO LAUNCH ELECTRONIC CARCASS AUCTIONS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Meat Board would launch electronic carcass auctions at the end of this month, it said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The board said it would control the auctions and act as auctionmaster.</p>
<p>The electronic auction system would be supplied by &quot;agri-exchange&quot; Agmex, which recently launched an electronic maize auction system.</p>
<p>The first auction would be held on October 29.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
